 "name": "Three Kittens",
 "rev": 2,
 "about": "Praline, Sesame and Meringue, Mixer's cats, as a very serious street crew for seven seconds: Three Kittens track is our own punchy electronic instrumental made in the app with ACE-Step 1.5 (its music runs 7 s, then the song is silent, so the part is its first 7.5 s). Shots 4 and 7 are real LTX-2.5 takes of Meringue, made in Mixer for the Face Dance trend (her face keeps that trend's beat; their sound is left out); the others are still pictures of the three (Codex's GPT Image, from their pictures) moved with ffmpeg: animated stills, not footage; Roll a shot with LTX-2.5 to make it real. A cut on every other beat Jam's finder heard (the bar line set on the kick), our own call-outs as comic captions, a zoom on every beat, a flash on every bar, shakes and a colour hit at the end. The film is the edit as the app exports it.",
